  "_": "The staged roll-out of a release, as the app's own updater and the office updater (server/src/system/rollout.ts, tests/unit/g-rollout.test.ts) and the root update timer (native/cmd/mycel-ctl/rollout.go, TestRolloutMatchesServer) decide it. bucket = sha256(salt + installId)'s first two bytes, big-endian, % 100 (no install id: 99, the last wave); in = bucket < percent. percent: no rollout 100; no ramp, an urgent release or the beta channel: rollout.percent; else the ramp step with the largest afterHours (a tie: the larger percent) not after now - publishedAt (a clock behind publishedAt counts as 0 h; none passed: 0; publishedAt that is not RFC 3339: the last step). wait false: the install takes it now; wait true: turn is the first ramp step that reaches its bucket, null when none does. defaultRamp: what the publish scripts write for a stable release (newRollout).",
